    "answer": {
      "short": "For q: $(a^3b^{-2})^2$ or $(b^2a^{-3})^{-2}$.\n\nFor r: $\\left(\\dfrac{m^2}{n^3}\\right)^3$ or $\\left(\\dfrac{n^3}{m^2}\\right)^{-3}$.",
      "worked": "For q:\n$$\\begin{align*}(a^3b^{-2})^2&=a^6b^{-4}\\\\(b^2a^{-3})^{-2}&=b^{-4}a^6\\end{align*}$$\nFor r:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\left(\\frac{m^2}{n^3}\\right)^3&=\\frac{m^6}{n^9}\\\\\\left(\\frac{n^3}{m^2}\\right)^{-3}&=\\left(\\frac{m^2}{n^3}\\right)^3\\\\\\left(\\frac{n^3}{m^2}\\right)^{-3}&=\\frac{m^6}{n^9}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
